WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.005 line:78%
If your name isn't available…Welcome, Architect.

00:00:03.055 --> 00:00:06.736 line:78%
I want you to know how genuinely honored I am that you're here.

00:00:06.786 --> 00:00:14.323 line:78%
Out of all the ways you could have chosen to invest your time, your energy, and your
future, you've chosen to invest in yourself.

00:00:14.373 --> 00:00:21.034 line:78%
That decision alone tells me something important about you—you believe your life can
become more than it is today.

00:00:21.084 --> 00:00:22.428 line:78%
And I believe that too.

00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:28.613 line:78%
The Back Half was created from one simple but life-changing realization: Life is not
transformed by time.

00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:30.475 line:78%
It is transformed by intention.

00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:37.303 line:78%
For many of us, there comes a moment when we realize we've been living the life we
thought we were supposed to live.

00:00:37.353 --> 00:00:41.852 line:78%
We meet expectations. We achieve goals. We build careers. We care for others.

00:00:41.902 --> 00:00:46.167 line:78%
Yet somewhere along the way, we begin wondering: Is there more than this?

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:51.359 line:78%
Not because our lives are bad. But because something inside us longs to feel more
alive.

00:00:51.409 --> 00:00:52.609 line:78%
I know that feeling.

00:00:52.659 --> 00:00:56.749 line:78%
It became the catalyst for creating everything you'll experience here.

00:00:56.799 --> 00:01:00.831 line:78%
Over the next seven chapters, I won't ask you to become someone else.

00:01:00.881 --> 00:01:05.672 line:78%
I'll invite you to become more fully who you already know you're capable of being.

00:01:05.722 --> 00:01:09.111 line:78%
You'll reflect honestly. You'll make courageous decisions.

00:01:09.161 --> 00:01:13.894 line:78%
You'll establish standards that shape your future. You'll embrace a new identity.

00:01:13.944 --> 00:01:18.911 line:78%
And you'll begin intentionally creating a life of fullness, purpose, and
possibility.

00:01:18.961 --> 00:01:23.284 line:78%
There is no race through this Journey. Move thoughtfully. Answer honestly.

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:28.359 line:78%
Give yourself permission to pause when a question deserves more than a quick
response.

00:01:28.409 --> 00:01:33.259 line:78%
The quality of your Back Half will be determined by the quality of your engagement.

00:01:33.309 --> 00:01:36.523 line:78%
As you move forward, remember one thing above all else.

00:01:36.573 --> 00:01:39.611 line:78%
You don't have to have everything figured out today.

00:01:39.661 --> 00:01:43.284 line:78%
You only need to be willing to take the next intentional step.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:47.950 line:78%
I'm grateful to walk beside you through this Journey. Welcome to The Back Half.

00:01:47.1000 --> 00:01:53.025 line:78%
Your greatest chapters are still ahead. Magical is Possible. In Gratitude, Kimberly
M.

00:01:53.075 --> 00:01:53.875 line:78%
Walker, Founder
